{"item": "ds01", "show": "dbza", "youtube": "P8FzFz7Oulc", "title": "Two and a Half Saiyans", "duration": 252, "lines": [{"i": 0, "start": 0.94, "end": 5.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Listen, it was YOUR idea to leave me in charge while you're off on your little \"business trip\","}, {"i": 1, "start": 5.84, "end": 7.05, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "So just let me handle it."}, {"i": 2, "start": 7.05, "end": 8.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Bulma", "text": "[squeaky phone chatter]"}, {"i": 3, "start": 8.44, "end": 11.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Woman, I have been conquering literal WORLDS since I was ten."}, {"i": 4, "start": 11.74, "end": 14.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "How hard is it to look after a single infant!?"}, {"i": 5, "start": 14.22, "end": 16.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Bulma", "text": "[squeaky phone chatter]"}, {"i": 6, "start": 16.0, "end": 18.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Yes, I know all the emergency numbers,"}, {"i": 7, "start": 18.06, "end": 21.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "but I'm pretty sure I can get him to a hospital faster than an ambulance."}, {"i": 8, "start": 21.18, "end": 23.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Bulma", "text": "[squeaky phone chatter]"}, {"i": 9, "start": 23.16, "end": 24.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "What do you mean you called his uncle?"}, {"i": 10, "start": 24.8, "end": 25.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "You don't have a brother-"}, {"i": 11, "start": 25.52, "end": 26.02, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "SLAM"}, {"i": 12, "start": 26.02, "end": 28.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "VEEEEGGEEEEEETAAAA~!"}, {"i": 13, "start": 28.62, "end": 29.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "NOOOOOO"}, {"i": 14, "start": 29.22, "end": 29.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO (yeeeeeesssss)"}, {"i": 15, "start": 29.96, "end": 36.8, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Special rendition of \"Cha-La Head Cha-La\" plays"}, {"i": 16, "start": 37.2, "end": 38.05, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[cooing]"}, {"i": 17, "start": 38.05, "end": 40.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Oh my God, he's so tiny! BABY TRUNKS: [cooing]"}, {"i": 18, "start": 40.18, "end": 41.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "I remember when you were this tiny. BABY TRUNKS: [cooing]"}, {"i": 19, "start": 41.96, "end": 44.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "GOD, I could punt you so far. BABY TRUNKS: [cooing]"}, {"i": 20, "start": 44.4, "end": 44.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[cooing]"}, {"i": 21, "start": 45.04, "end": 46.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "You mean \"could've\"."}, {"i": 22, "start": 46.24, "end": 46.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "I-I-uh..."}, {"i": 23, "start": 46.94, "end": 48.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Where's his tail?"}, {"i": 24, "start": 48.02, "end": 50.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "The woman apparently had it removed at birth."}, {"i": 25, "start": 50.24, "end": 51.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "And you DIDN'T STOP HER!?"}, {"i": 26, "start": 51.94, "end": 53.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I WASN'T THERE!"}, {"i": 27, "start": 53.1, "end": 55.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "You are a bad dad and a terrible partner."}, {"i": 28, "start": 55.74, "end": 57.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I will kill you again."}, {"i": 29, "start": 57.28, "end": 57.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "But don't worry!"}, {"i": 30, "start": 57.94, "end": 59.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Unkie Nappa's here to help!"}, {"i": 31, "start": 59.52, "end": 62.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Tip #1: Whatever you do,"}, {"i": 32, "start": 62.4, "end": 63.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "DON'T."}, {"i": 33, "start": 63.12, "end": 63.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "DON'T. SHAKE."}, {"i": 34, "start": 63.8, "end": 65.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "DON'T. SHAKE. THE BABY."}, {"i": 35, "start": 65.0, "end": 65.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "..............."}, {"i": 36, "start": 65.72, "end": 66.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "What?"}, {"i": 37, "start": 66.22, "end": 67.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Don't grab him under the arms,"}, {"i": 38, "start": 67.58, "end": 69.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "and shake the SHIT out of him..."}, {"i": 39, "start": 69.56, "end": 70.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "...while screaming,"}, {"i": 40, "start": 70.52, "end": 71.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "\"YOU'RE WEAK!\""}, {"i": 41, "start": 71.22, "end": 72.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "\"YOU'RE WEAK! \"AND WORTHLESS!\""}, {"i": 42, "start": 72.08, "end": 73.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "\"YOU'RE WEAK!\" \"AND WORTHLESS!\" \"AND YOU'LL NEVER BE KING!\""}, {"i": 43, "start": 73.9, "end": 75.1, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "cackling] (You're scaring me, plz stop Nappa"}, {"i": 44, "start": 75.32, "end": 75.99, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Why..."}, {"i": 45, "start": 75.99, "end": 76.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Why would I—?"}, {"i": 46, "start": 76.62, "end": 78.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Trust me, it'll give him a complex."}, {"i": 47, "start": 78.78, "end": 81.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Tip #2: Don't force-feed him coffee."}, {"i": 48, "start": 81.86, "end": 83.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "It'll stunt his growth."}, {"i": 49, "start": 83.42, "end": 85.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "These tips are oddly specific, did—"}, {"i": 50, "start": 85.28, "end": 86.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Kid's flyin' out the window."}, {"i": 51, "start": 86.48, "end": 87.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "SHIT!"}, {"i": 52, "start": 87.02, "end": 88.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "He yeeted himself-"}, {"i": 53, "start": 88.48, "end": 91.3, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "panting"}, {"i": 54, "start": 91.42, "end": 92.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Maybe shake him a little...."}, {"i": 55, "start": 93.28, "end": 94.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[whining]"}, {"i": 56, "start": 94.26, "end": 95.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Wha- What's he--?"}, {"i": 57, "start": 95.78, "end": 97.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[crying]"}, {"i": 58, "start": 97.5, "end": 98.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Stop."}, {"i": 59, "start": 98.0, "end": 98.58, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Still crying"}, {"i": 60, "start": 98.58, "end": 99.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "STOP."}, {"i": 61, "start": 99.08, "end": 99.64, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Nothing changed"}, {"i": 62, "start": 99.64, "end": 101.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "STOP THIS RIGHT NOW!!"}, {"i": 63, "start": 101.24, "end": 102.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "You should yell louder. BABY TRUNKS: [continues crying]"}, {"i": 64, "start": 102.32, "end": 103.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "STOOOOOOOOP!!!"}, {"i": 65, "start": 103.5, "end": 104.58, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Here we go"}, {"i": 66, "start": 104.58, "end": 106.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "STOOOOOOOOOOOOO-"}, {"i": 67, "start": 106.52, "end": 108.24, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "10 Minutes Later..) BABY TRUNKS: [continues crying"}, {"i": 68, "start": 108.24, "end": 109.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "He..."}, {"i": 69, "start": 109.06, "end": 110.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "He outscreamed me..."}, {"i": 70, "start": 110.66, "end": 112.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Nobody outscreams Vegeta!"}, {"i": 71, "start": 112.62, "end": 114.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "*mutters* Silver medal once again."}, {"i": 72, "start": 114.3, "end": 116.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Oh God, to make matters worse, he just smells awful!"}, {"i": 73, "start": 116.84, "end": 118.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Vegeta... BABY TRUNKS: [continues crying]"}, {"i": 74, "start": 118.06, "end": 119.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "You gotta change him."}, {"i": 75, "start": 119.48, "end": 121.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Into what? We already established he has no tail."}, {"i": 76, "start": 122.38, "end": 124.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "What do you think that diaper is for?"}, {"i": 77, "start": 125.0, "end": 125.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Oh..."}, {"i": 78, "start": 126.32, "end": 126.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "S H I T ."}, {"i": 79, "start": 126.9, "end": 128.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "That's the idea!"}, {"i": 80, "start": 129.42, "end": 131.54, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Okay, now be careful."}, {"i": 81, "start": 131.54, "end": 134.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Babies are known to pee during changing."}, {"i": 82, "start": 134.12, "end": 136.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I thought he already went; that's why we—"}, {"i": 83, "start": 136.56, "end": 138.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Whatever, let's just get this over wi—"}, {"i": 84, "start": 138.08, "end": 138.9, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "gurgling"}, {"i": 85, "start": 139.14, "end": 141.54, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "explosion] and then a DBZ reference (fricken duh"}, {"i": 86, "start": 141.54, "end": 142.8, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "I hope Veggie's okay"}, {"i": 87, "start": 143.2, "end": 144.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Hey look, Vegeta!"}, {"i": 88, "start": 144.46, "end": 145.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "He's got your stream!"}, {"i": 89, "start": 146.74, "end": 148.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "What are they feeding you?"}, {"i": 90, "start": 148.4, "end": 149.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "BABY TRUNKS [belching]"}, {"i": 91, "start": 149.32, "end": 153.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "And that's how Christmas was known throughout the galaxy as..."}, {"i": 92, "start": 153.66, "end": 155.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "...Freeza Day."}, {"i": 93, "start": 156.06, "end": 158.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "The End. [crib mobile music plays]"}, {"i": 94, "start": 161.46, "end": 163.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Oh my God, it's finally over..."}, {"i": 95, "start": 163.38, "end": 166.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "It's only scary the first time because you don't know what you're doing, right?"}, {"i": 96, "start": 166.94, "end": 168.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Just go easy on yourself."}, {"i": 97, "start": 168.76, "end": 169.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Huh..."}, {"i": 98, "start": 169.9, "end": 172.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "You know when he's uh, sleeping, for some reason..."}, {"i": 99, "start": 173.0, "end": 175.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "...all I want to do is kill anything that might touch him."}, {"i": 100, "start": 175.62, "end": 176.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Aww..."}, {"i": 101, "start": 176.28, "end": 178.42, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Guess who's a big ol' softie after all, huh?"}, {"i": 102, "start": 178.42, "end": 179.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "F**k you say!?!"}, {"i": 103, "start": 179.2, "end": 182.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Just sayin', Mr. \"Destroyer of Worlds\"."}, {"i": 104, "start": 182.0, "end": 184.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Got a baby boy, a nice big house,"}, {"i": 105, "start": 184.18, "end": 187.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "and a sugar mama that gave you both. [chuckling]"}, {"i": 106, "start": 187.02, "end": 189.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I am going to break off both of your legs,"}, {"i": 107, "start": 189.06, "end": 191.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "and then literally kick what's left of your ass with them!"}, {"i": 108, "start": 191.7, "end": 192.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "[chuckles] Alright, alright."}, {"i": 109, "start": 192.8, "end": 193.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "I'll get out of your hair."}, {"i": 110, "start": 194.4, "end": 196.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Good night, Trunks."}, {"i": 111, "start": 199.66, "end": 200.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Good night..."}, {"i": 112, "start": 201.92, "end": 202.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "..my son. (bet you that this is one of the best father son moment for Vegeta)"}, {"i": 113, "start": 203.68, "end": 204.2, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "camera snap"}, {"i": 114, "start": 204.2, "end": 205.18, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "To quote Vegeta, Oh S H I T ."}, {"i": 115, "start": 205.18, "end": 207.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Dis goin' on my Spacetagram."}, {"i": 116, "start": 207.4, "end": 209.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "GODDAMNIT, NAPPAAAAAAAAAAA!!!"}, {"i": 117, "start": 209.82, "end": 210.86, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "glass shattering"}, {"i": 118, "start": 210.86, "end": 211.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "GET BACK HERE!!! [Ki blast sound]"}, {"i": 119, "start": 211.86, "end": 213.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "#DaddysLittleBoy!"}, {"i": 120, "start": 213.6, "end": 215.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "DELETE THAT RIGHT NOW!"}, {"i": 121, "start": 215.1, "end": 216.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "#PapaVeggie!"}, {"i": 122, "start": 216.92, "end": 217.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "#GALICKGUN!"}, {"i": 123, "start": 217.66, "end": 219.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "#GALICKGUN! [Laser charging]"}, {"i": 124, "start": 219.06, "end": 219.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Whoa boy!"}, {"i": 125, "start": 219.64, "end": 220.36, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "laser charging"}, {"i": 126, "start": 220.36, "end": 221.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "And...post."}, {"i": 127, "start": 221.44, "end": 223.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "FIRE!!! [loud blast]"}, {"i": 128, "start": 223.52, "end": 225.8, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "car alarm blaring"}, {"i": 129, "start": 225.86, "end": 227.54, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "(cries again obviously)"}, {"i": 130, "start": 227.54, "end": 229.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Oh, goddammit."}, {"i": 131, "start": 229.24, "end": 230.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "#..."}, {"i": 132, "start": 230.26, "end": 232.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "#YouMissed. BABY TRUNKS: [continues crying] (of COURSE)"}], "segments": []}